data: {"event": "audit", "answer_final": "In 2024 JWST used NIRCam and MIRI to image the nearby star Vega, achieving F444W contrast levels of 3 × 10⁻⁷ at 1″, 1 × 10⁻⁷ at 2″, and a few × 10⁻⁸ beyond 5″, and identified two faint, extended objects in the outer debris disk that resemble distant extragalactic sources [[c:1]].\n\nA Discoveries Tracker entry dated 19 March 2024 notes that JWST continued to unlock new insights throughout that month, emphasizing the observatory’s ongoing impact on our understanding of the cosmos [[c:2]].\n\nA September 2024 summary lists the top five JWST discoveries of the year, highlighting breakthroughs in exoplanet science, striking deep‑space images, and new information on star‑formation processes [[c:4]].", "claims": [{"claim_id": 0, "text": "In 2024 JWST used NIRCam and MIRI to image the nearby star Vega, achieving F444W contrast levels of 3 × 10⁻⁷ at 1″, 1 × 10⁻⁷ at 2″, and a few × 10⁻⁸ beyond 5″, and identified two faint, extended objects in the outer debris disk that resemble distant extragalactic sources.", "citation_ids": [1], "evidence": "achieved F444W contrast levels of 3 × 10−7 at 1″ (7.7 au), 1 × 10−7 at 2″ (15 au), and a few × 10−8 beyond 5″ (38 au), corresponding to masses of <3, 2, and 0.5 M J for a system age of 700 Myr.; Two F444W objects are identified in the outer MIRI debris disk, around 48 au. One of these is detected by MIRI and appears to be extended with a spectral energy distribution similar to those of distant extragalactic sources.", "note": "Audit flagged: unverified numbers: 2024; unverified entities: 2024.", "supported": false, "status": "partially_supported", "coverage": 0.667, "start": 0, "end": 272}, {"claim_id": 1, "text": "A Discoveries Tracker entry dated 19 March 2024 notes that JWST continued to unlock new insights throughout that month, emphasizing the observatory’s ongoing impact on our understanding of the cosmos.", "citation_ids": [2], "evidence": "Mar 19, 2024 · James Webb Telescope Unlocks the Universe's Secrets: March 2024 Discoveries; The James Webb Space Telescope (JWST), humanity's most powerful observatory, continues to revolutionize our understanding of the cosmos.", "note": "Audit flagged: insufficient quote coverage (40.0% < 60%).", "supported": false, "status": "partially_supported", "coverage": 0.4, "start": 282, "end": 482}, {"claim_id": 2, "text": "A September 2024 summary lists the top five JWST discoveries of the year, highlighting breakthroughs in exoplanet science, striking deep‑space images, and new information on star‑formation processes.", "citation_ids": [4], "evidence": "Sep 27, 2024 · The top James Webb Space Telescope discoveries of 2024, including exoplanet breakthroughs, deep space images, and insights into star formation.", "note": "Audit flagged: insufficient quote coverage (42.1% < 60%); unverified entities: September.", "supported": false, "status": "partially_supported", "coverage": 0.421, "start": 741, "end": 948}], "removed_claims": [{"text": "JWST observations have also revealed apparently “anomalous” early‑forming galaxies whose masses challenge standard expectations for galaxy growth, prompting theoretical work to explain these findings without revising established cosmology.", "reason": "Source quote coverage below 30% (0.0%)"}], "conflicts": [], "retractions": [], "confidence": 0.39, "tier_agreement": null, "repaired": true, "sources": [{"source": "https://doi.org/10.1117/1.jatis.10.1.011208", "source_type": "openalex", "tier": "LIVE", "similarity": null, "is_retracted": false, "rank": 1, "published": "2024-02-05", "cited": false}, {"source": "https://doi.org/10.3847/1538-3881/ad890d", "source_type": "openalex", "tier": "LIVE", "similarity": null, "is_retracted": false, "rank": 2, "published": "2024-12-10", "cited": true}, {"source": "https://blog.jameswebbdiscovery.com/2024/03/james-webb-space-telescope-discoveries.html", "source_type": "duckduckgo", "tier": "LIVE", "similarity": null, "is_retracted": false, "rank": 3, "published": "2024", "cited": true}, {"source": "https://doi.org/10.33140/ssj.01.02.10", "source_type": "openalex", "tier": "LIVE", "similarity": null, "is_retracted": false, "rank": 4, "published": "2024-08-02", "cited": false}, {"source": "https://blog.jaseph.com/top-5-james-webb-telescope-discoveries-in-2024/8934/", "source_type": "duckduckgo", "tier": "LIVE", "similarity": null, "is_retracted": false, "rank": 5, "published": "2024", "cited": true}]}

